1
00:00:22,860 --> 00:00:28,120
♪I scaled sheer cliffs for lingzhi,
then found you gathering moonlight♪

2
00:00:28,920 --> 00:00:33,420
♪Two baskets of silver glow
rang out like stone against steel♪

3
00:00:33,810 --> 00:00:37,100
♪You said to cure me of my hesitation♪

4
00:00:37,100 --> 00:00:39,930
♪I'd need nine measures
of wind from the cliffs♪

5
00:00:40,160 --> 00:00:45,280
♪And three measures of a heartbeat
that stops when our eyes meet♪

6
00:00:46,560 --> 00:00:49,900
♪I caught your wrist and said♪

7
00:00:49,900 --> 00:00:54,450
♪This condition is already beyond cure♪

8
00:00:54,460 --> 00:00:56,860
=Hanyi Enters The Heart=

9
00:00:56,860 --> 00:00:59,780
=Episode 20=

10
00:01:03,110 --> 00:01:03,580
Watch out!

11
00:01:07,020 --> 00:01:07,710
Master!

12
00:01:08,910 --> 00:01:09,580
Get out of here!

13
00:01:16,950 --> 00:01:17,990
They're not human.

14
00:01:18,540 --> 00:01:19,220
They're monsters.

15
00:01:20,150 --> 00:01:21,110
They feel no pain

16
00:01:21,470 --> 00:01:22,110
and fear no death.

17
00:01:22,660 --> 00:01:23,500
Even blades can barely harm them.

18
00:01:23,590 --> 00:01:24,540
Once on the battlefield,

19
00:01:25,060 --> 00:01:26,310
they become indestructible puppets.

20
00:01:39,790 --> 00:01:40,790
What do we do?

21
00:02:04,580 --> 00:02:05,820
(Poison Soldier Method)

22
00:02:10,110 --> 00:02:11,700
Using epidemic poison on living people

23
00:02:12,030 --> 00:02:14,260
will turn their skin dark
and cause it to fester,

24
00:02:14,260 --> 00:02:15,470
with maggots breeding in their wounds,

25
00:02:15,620 --> 00:02:18,110
until they become monsters
neither human nor ghost.

26
00:02:18,110 --> 00:02:19,110
Their eyes will be vacant.

27
00:02:19,340 --> 00:02:20,590
Even blades can barely harm them.

28
00:02:20,750 --> 00:02:22,470
They move like walking corpses.

29
00:02:22,950 --> 00:02:23,980
The way to defeat them is...

30
00:02:24,980 --> 00:02:25,590
I found it.

31
00:02:26,950 --> 00:02:28,870
Cinnabar can impair their senses.

32
00:02:29,670 --> 00:02:31,590
Peach wood
can pierce their vital channels.

33
00:02:32,060 --> 00:02:32,590
Salt water

34
00:02:32,670 --> 00:02:33,950
can drain their strength.

35
00:02:35,750 --> 00:02:36,340
Salt water.

36
00:02:47,950 --> 00:02:48,780
Master, get down!

37
00:03:05,630 --> 00:03:06,510
Master, are you all right?

38
00:03:07,790 --> 00:03:08,910
You found a way to stop them?

39
00:03:10,230 --> 00:03:10,950
It's salt water.

40
00:03:11,260 --> 00:03:13,260
It can temporarily render
the poison soldiers unable to attack.

41
00:03:14,260 --> 00:03:14,790
Master.

42
00:03:16,230 --> 00:03:17,910
I found
the real epidemic poison chapter.

43
00:03:23,190 --> 00:03:23,630
General.

44
00:03:37,140 --> 00:03:39,020
It seems Shen Li
is remarkably hard to kill.

45
00:03:40,390 --> 00:03:41,670
Even Grand Secretary Cui Hong

46
00:03:42,580 --> 00:03:44,300
tried to kill her time and again,

47
00:03:44,740 --> 00:03:46,140
yet still failed to take her life.

48
00:03:47,420 --> 00:03:48,140
I have failed you.

49
00:03:48,580 --> 00:03:49,740
Please forgive me, General.

50
00:03:50,230 --> 00:03:51,670
Fortunately,
we sent the poison soldiers.

51
00:03:52,830 --> 00:03:54,300
Otherwise, we would
have suffered heavy losses.

52
00:04:01,670 --> 00:04:02,540
Please forgive me, General.

53
00:04:03,630 --> 00:04:04,540
As for those six poison soldiers,

54
00:04:04,910 --> 00:04:06,420
somehow, Shen Li

55
00:04:07,110 --> 00:04:08,190
subdued them all

56
00:04:08,740 --> 00:04:10,070
with just a basin of water.

57
00:04:10,700 --> 00:04:12,300
We don't know what was mixed into it.

58
00:04:12,790 --> 00:04:13,350
Useless!

59
00:04:15,260 --> 00:04:16,700
Move all
the poison soldiers immediately.

60
00:04:17,300 --> 00:04:18,510
Erase every trace of them.

61
00:04:19,510 --> 00:04:21,190
Do not leave behind a single clue.

62
00:04:23,070 --> 00:04:23,830
As you command, General.

63
00:04:33,110 --> 00:04:34,300
According to
the epidemic poison chapter,

64
00:04:34,950 --> 00:04:36,630
there are three ways
to counter the poison soldiers.

65
00:04:37,510 --> 00:04:39,540
Cinnabar can impair their senses.

66
00:04:39,910 --> 00:04:41,540
Peach wood
can pierce their vital channels.

67
00:04:42,980 --> 00:04:44,830
Salt water can drain their strength.

68
00:04:46,140 --> 00:04:47,860
But I've tried all three methods.

69
00:04:48,230 --> 00:04:48,950
They can only suppress them,

70
00:04:48,980 --> 00:04:49,740
not destroy them completely.

71
00:04:53,790 --> 00:04:55,390
However, The Forbidden Qingnang Formulas
also states

72
00:04:55,980 --> 00:04:57,420
that whether human or monster,

73
00:04:58,110 --> 00:05:00,420
all movement is controlled by the brain.

74
00:05:01,630 --> 00:05:03,230
If we can destroy their brains,

75
00:05:03,830 --> 00:05:05,630
we may be able to eliminate
the poison soldiers for good.

76
00:05:06,140 --> 00:05:07,980
Ordinary blades
can barely harm their bodies.

77
00:05:08,630 --> 00:05:09,740
How can we destroy their heads?

78
00:05:11,980 --> 00:05:12,540
Pry their mouths open,

79
00:05:13,430 --> 00:05:14,190
stuff them with gunpowder,

80
00:05:14,660 --> 00:05:15,140
and blow their heads apart.

81
00:05:15,750 --> 00:05:17,020
The poison soldiers
are immensely strong and vicious.

82
00:05:17,310 --> 00:05:18,830
It's difficult enough for an ordinary person
to get close to them.

83
00:05:19,660 --> 00:05:20,870
How could anyone pry their mouths open?

84
00:05:21,510 --> 00:05:22,550
The poison soldiers fear light.

85
00:05:23,220 --> 00:05:24,830
As long as we
lure them into bright light,

86
00:05:24,950 --> 00:05:26,340
they'll bare their teeth and growl.

87
00:05:26,830 --> 00:05:27,460
At that moment,

88
00:05:27,750 --> 00:05:29,020
we'll have the perfect chance
to put in the gunpowder.

89
00:05:31,100 --> 00:05:34,660
Li, you've thought of everything.

90
00:05:45,910 --> 00:05:47,900
I have some bad news.

91
00:05:48,770 --> 00:05:50,140
Would you two like to hear it?

92
00:05:52,070 --> 00:05:54,830
Xiao Jing moved
the poison soldiers overnight.

93
00:05:55,340 --> 00:05:57,140
I haven't found out
where he's hidden them yet.

94
00:05:58,430 --> 00:05:58,990
And

95
00:06:00,190 --> 00:06:01,660
he seems to have grown suspicious of me.

96
00:06:02,390 --> 00:06:03,390
Then you can't go back.

97
00:06:03,700 --> 00:06:04,510
It's too dangerous.

98
00:06:07,050 --> 00:06:08,780
Perhaps I'm just being overly cautious.

99
00:06:09,510 --> 00:06:11,220
But I have to return to his side

100
00:06:11,750 --> 00:06:13,390
and finish this one last thing.

101
00:06:18,510 --> 00:06:19,140
Mei Jiu.

102
00:06:20,460 --> 00:06:20,830
Li.

103
00:06:21,190 --> 00:06:21,580
Mei Jiu.

104
00:06:24,750 --> 00:06:27,190
Mei Jiu is exceptionally quick-witted.

105
00:06:28,140 --> 00:06:29,070
If she's in danger,

106
00:06:30,260 --> 00:06:31,190
she'll surely send us a signal.

107
00:06:40,830 --> 00:06:43,990
I've brought
one piece of good news today

108
00:06:44,460 --> 00:06:45,340
and one piece of bad news.

109
00:06:46,070 --> 00:06:48,310
Which would
Your Majesty like to hear first?

110
00:06:50,660 --> 00:06:52,550
Keeping me in suspense

111
00:06:52,660 --> 00:06:53,900
could cost you your head.

112
00:06:55,430 --> 00:06:56,310
I'll hear the good news.

113
00:06:57,460 --> 00:06:58,340
It's the epidemic poison chapter.

114
00:06:59,750 --> 00:07:00,340
It's been found.

115
00:07:01,900 --> 00:07:02,780
Who found it?

116
00:07:03,260 --> 00:07:04,020
And where?

117
00:07:04,780 --> 00:07:05,390
Li did.

118
00:07:05,990 --> 00:07:07,460
It was hidden within
The Forbidden Qingnang Formulas.

119
00:07:08,070 --> 00:07:08,580
When exposed to water,

120
00:07:09,700 --> 00:07:11,190
the epidemic poison chapter
reveals itself.

121
00:07:13,220 --> 00:07:13,900
Ingenious.

122
00:07:14,430 --> 00:07:15,310
Truly ingenious.

123
00:07:16,780 --> 00:07:18,100
The Shen family has rendered

124
00:07:18,460 --> 00:07:19,510
extraordinary service to me

125
00:07:20,020 --> 00:07:21,260
and to all the people of this realm.

126
00:07:21,630 --> 00:07:22,900
Now tell me the bad news.

127
00:07:24,220 --> 00:07:24,870
Last night,

128
00:07:25,390 --> 00:07:26,900
Xiao Jing sent six poison soldiers

129
00:07:27,630 --> 00:07:28,700
to assassinate Shen Li.

130
00:07:29,950 --> 00:07:30,830
What happened?

131
00:07:31,780 --> 00:07:32,550
Fortunately, they failed.

132
00:07:33,830 --> 00:07:34,900
I came to see Your Majesty today

133
00:07:35,390 --> 00:07:37,580
to discuss
how we can bring down Xiao Jing.

134
00:07:38,020 --> 00:07:40,700
Although we've managed
to subdue six poison soldiers for now,

135
00:07:40,950 --> 00:07:42,510
they're unpredictable
and prone to mutation.

136
00:07:43,550 --> 00:07:44,510
They remain a grave threat.

137
00:07:48,950 --> 00:07:50,950
We now have both
witnesses and physical evidence,

138
00:07:52,460 --> 00:07:54,070
but one crucial piece is still missing.

139
00:07:57,070 --> 00:07:59,070
What does Your Majesty mean?

140
00:08:04,510 --> 00:08:05,430
To catch a criminal,

141
00:08:08,140 --> 00:08:09,020
we must catch him with the evidence.

142
00:09:03,660 --> 00:09:04,220
Who's there?

143
00:09:12,310 --> 00:09:12,830
General.

144
00:09:23,950 --> 00:09:25,020
You entered the basement

145
00:09:26,070 --> 00:09:27,340
while I was asleep.

146
00:09:31,860 --> 00:09:33,030
How do you explain yourself?

147
00:09:34,310 --> 00:09:37,380
I was only worried

148
00:09:37,980 --> 00:09:39,740
that you might be hiding
some singers or dancers in the residence.

149
00:09:39,790 --> 00:09:40,430
Haitang!

150
00:09:41,950 --> 00:09:43,830
How much longer
do you intend to deceive me?

151
00:09:47,580 --> 00:09:49,910
You tampered with my wrist guard.

152
00:09:49,910 --> 00:09:51,070
Did you really think I wouldn't notice?

153
00:09:52,740 --> 00:09:53,910
When did you find out?

154
00:09:55,030 --> 00:09:56,500
I should be asking you that.

155
00:09:59,220 --> 00:10:01,030
When did you start betraying me?

156
00:10:02,500 --> 00:10:04,190
And why?

157
00:10:18,430 --> 00:10:19,500
Who are you really working for?

158
00:10:21,740 --> 00:10:22,550
Shen Li?

159
00:10:23,910 --> 00:10:24,500
The Emperor?

160
00:10:26,340 --> 00:10:27,310
Or did they join forces

161
00:10:29,550 --> 00:10:31,150
and send you to my side

162
00:10:31,150 --> 00:10:32,380
to bring about my downfall?

163
00:10:34,430 --> 00:10:35,430
I created the poison soldiers,

164
00:10:35,790 --> 00:10:36,460
defying the natural order

165
00:10:36,500 --> 00:10:37,310
and breaking the laws of the realm.

166
00:10:37,910 --> 00:10:38,910
The Emperor cannot tolerate me,

167
00:10:39,550 --> 00:10:40,700
so he had you stay by my side

168
00:10:40,700 --> 00:10:41,700
to gather evidence of my crimes.

169
00:10:41,740 --> 00:10:42,670
Am I right?

170
00:10:45,580 --> 00:10:46,460
Answer me!

171
00:10:49,150 --> 00:10:49,740
General.

172
00:10:50,950 --> 00:10:52,190
Since you've already
seen through everything,

173
00:10:54,550 --> 00:10:57,270
I have nothing more to say.

174
00:10:58,340 --> 00:10:59,270
I ask only for death.

175
00:11:02,740 --> 00:11:05,950
Do you really think I won't kill you?

176
00:11:23,810 --> 00:11:26,670
♪Every step is hard,
every step fraught with danger♪

177
00:11:27,430 --> 00:11:30,370
♪Every step is a battle with no retreat♪

178
00:11:31,030 --> 00:11:33,850
♪As dawn approaches, those still asleep♪

179
00:11:34,700 --> 00:11:37,690
♪Know nothing
of the bitter cold of the long night♪

180
00:11:38,540 --> 00:11:41,860
♪If fate had not woven its threads
and spurred everything along♪

181
00:11:42,200 --> 00:11:45,490
♪How could we witness life's upheavals
and the passing of time?♪

182
00:11:45,840 --> 00:11:52,320
♪If this grand dream is destined to
be absurd, with no answer to be found♪

183
00:11:53,110 --> 00:12:00,200
♪How I wish that when I wake,
I could still be by your side♪

184
00:12:02,700 --> 00:12:10,550
♪However distant the past,
however far the future♪

185
00:12:10,850 --> 00:12:12,660
♪I stand here today♪

186
00:12:12,800 --> 00:12:17,310
♪Unable to turn back,
with no shore in sight♪

187
00:12:17,310 --> 00:12:24,800
♪Between black and white, once a piece
is placed, there is no regret♪

188
00:12:25,440 --> 00:12:26,730
♪You stepped into the game yourself♪

189
00:12:26,730 --> 00:12:29,130
♪Shielding me from hidden arrows♪

190
00:12:29,570 --> 00:12:36,420
♪Leaving me to a lifetime of solitude♪
